    "title": "Scully leads Men's Golf at Wartburg Fall Shootout - NewsBreak",
    "text": "kohawkathletics.com\nwebsite\nWaverly\nScully leads Men's Golf at Wartburg Fall Shootout\n1 days ago\nWAVERLY, Iowa – The Coe College men's golf team took place in a midweek 18-hole tournament Tuesday, facing off with Wartburg and Luther at Prairie Links. Senior Sam Scully posted an even-round 72 to lead the Coe men, placing third overall with three birdies on the day. Tyler Santi also finished in the top 10, firing a 76 on Tuesday to place T10. Jackson Pipho (78, T15) and Mitchell Katz (83, T31) rounded out the team scoring for Coe which shot a total score of 309. Coe's second team in the tournament shot 312, led by Brooks Hoffland (78, T11) who made four birdies in his round. Caden Weddingfeld and C. Reece Breitenbach each fired 78s while Robbie Allison and Tommy Kulesza shot 79 to conclude the team scores.",
